@format 1
@id split.section-divide
@title Divide section
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Divide the selected section at the cursor and select the left half.
@section I. UI
@tabs Split
@flow TB
@related shared.synchronize-sections
@tag section
@tag section-divide

@alias flow = Cadroue.UIShell.PFlow.PFlow
@alias segment = Cadroue.Core.LSegment

[input] Divide section command <input>
- Receive the section command in the active Split timeline @ flow.PFlowSectionDivide(...)
> validate

[validate] Validate section request <decision>
- Require an active section and a cursor strictly inside its start and end boundaries @ segment.LSegmentDivide(...)
? "A valid section plan is produced" > apply
? "The request cannot produce a valid plan" > unchanged

[apply] Apply section plan <process>
- Replace the source section with the two returned halves @ flow.PFlowSectionApply(...)
- Record both resulting halves in the log @ flow.PFlowSectionRecord(...)
> fragment:shared.synchronize-sections

[unchanged] No change <output>
=The request does not change the section model.
